-// the admin letter alone as Administration, any other job as Civilian. No job of H9's maps holds i: give the insurgent jobs i when they are made.
+// the admin letter alone as Administration, any other job as Civilian. The Insurrection jobs of H9's two maps hold i (docs\ARP_CONTENT.txt, 3).
 arp_h9_insurgent_access "i"
 
